hadiths[14]{hadithnumber,text}:
"129","Abu Hurayra said"
"130","Mundhir at-Tawri reported what Muhammad ibn 'Ali (ibn al-Hanafiyya)\nsaid about"
"131","Abu Hurayra reported that the Prophet"
"132","'A'isha said"
"133","Umm Sa'id bint Murra al-Fihri related from her father that the Prophet"
"134","Al-Hasan reported that an orphan used to eat with Ibn 'Umar. One day\nhe called for food and looked for this orphan but could not find him. He\narrived after Ibn 'Umar had finished. Ibn 'Umar called for more food to be\nbrought to him but they did not have any. So he was brought sawiq and honey.\nHe said"
"135","Sahl ibn Sa'd reported that the Prophet"
"136","Abu Bakr ibn Hafs reported that 'Abdullah would not eat unless an orphan\nwas at his table."""""
"137","Abu Hurayra reported that the Messenger of Allah"
"138","how ugly is misguidance after guidance! When you make a promise to your friend"
"139","Al-Hasan said"
"140","Asma' bint 'Ubayd said"
"141","'Awf ibn Malik reported that the Prophet"
"142","Shumaysa al-'Atakiyya said"
